SUMMARY: All accessible requirements from ACCESSIBILITY.md are met. The page
adheres to WCAG 2.2 AA with proper contrast in both themes, full keyboard
operability with visible focus, HTMX-aware focus handling and aria-live
announcements for mutations, tables with proper semantic markup, charts with
data-table fallbacks and text summaries, and Transfer status indicated by icon
+ text, not color alone. Test coverage includes assertions on the actual
rendered HTML per ruling 2026-08-16a, and proves the review queue persists via
the DataLoader.ResolveTransfer contract (ruling requirement 3).
